Renux 0.1-CURRENT: a modern operating system that runs FreeBSD programs.

This userland is FreeBSD's own: login(1), sh(1) and the base utilities run
unchanged on the Renux kernel through the FreeBSD/amd64 ABI.

Source and documentation: https://github.com/Renan2010p/renux

Edit /var/run/motd to change this login announcement.
